        "original_id": "9b17d3ca-905a-5d83-94be-03bd292f84a2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: William Boyd, Jim Thompson, Howard Koch, Casey Robinson, Julius J. Epstein, Philip G. Epstein\n- Works: Any Human Heart: The Intimate Journals of Logan Mountstuart, The Killer Inside Me, Casablanca\n- Roles: novelists, screenwriters\n\nFacts:\n- William Boyd, the author of Any Human Heart: The Intimate Journals of Logan Mountstuart, was British.\n- Jim Thompson wrote the 1952 novel The Killer Inside Me.\n- Casablanca had screenwriters including Howard Koch, Casey Robinson, Julius J. Epstein, and Philip G. Epstein.\n- William Boyd was not a screenwriter for Casablanca.\n- Jim Thompson was not a screenwriter for Casablanca.",
